#: app/data/fastner.data.ts#getConsultant
msgid ""
"At Sebastian Software, I work as a Senior Technology Consultant where frontend"
" architecture, full-stack SaaS, mobile, and internationalization intersect. "
"Not as an external contractor who simply delivers code, but as a partner who "
"shares knowledge, makes product decisions technically robust, and helps teams "
"move forward."
msgstr ""
"Bei Sebastian Software bin ich als Senior Technology Consultant dort "
"unterwegs, wo Frontend-Architektur, Fullstack-SaaS, Mobile und "
